      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F007200740065002C0020007600650072006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mitico! Mitico! Miticooo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069007400690063006F00210020004D0069007400690063006F00210020004D0069007400690063006F006F006F0021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quindi sai tante cose sulla megaevoluzione?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750069006E006400690020007300610069002000740061006E0074006500200063006F00730065002000730075006C006C00610020006D00650067006100650076006F006C0075007A0069006F006E0065003F001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ehi! Facciamoci insegnare la megaevoluzione da\nquest<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa Allenat<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂orrice, dai!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh? Ma allora più che un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿଊ Allenator’Allenatrice è un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā ’espert<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa\ndella megaevoluzione!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Signor<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̀ina espert<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa della megaevoluzione!\nDai, insegnaci tutto quello che sai!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anche se lavora alla Q-asar Inc. papà non vuole\ndarmi un Megacerchio. Uffa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La megaevoluzione è una forza! Lo sanno tutti!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020006D00650067006100650076006F006C0075007A0069006F006E0065002000E800200075006E006100200066006F0072007A006100210020004C006F002000730061006E006E006F0020007400750074007400690021001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma i maestri della nostra scuola non sanno far\nmegaevolvere i Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anch’io voglio un Megacerchio per far\nmegaevolvere il mio Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0063006820190069006F00200076006F0067006C0069006F00200075006E0020004D006500670061006300650072006300680069006F00200070006500720020006600610072000A006D00650067006100650076006F006C007600650072006500200069006C0020006D0069006F00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0021001000020114019C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Signor<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̀ina espert<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa della megaevoluzione!\nFacci una lezione speciale, dai!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Va bene, cominciamo subito!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061002000620065006E0065002C00200063006F006D0069006E006300690061006D006F002000730075006200690074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non è il momento giusto...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002000E800200069006C0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002000670069007500730074006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ok, ok! Allora aspettiamo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006B002C0020006F006B002100200041006C006C006F00720061002000610073007000650074007400690061006D006F0021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Evviva! Allora ti facciamo una domanda a testa.\nInizio io!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500760076006900760061002100200041006C006C006F007200610020007400690020006600610063006300690061006D006F00200075006E006100200064006F006D0061006E0064006100200061002000740065007300740061002E000A0049006E0069007A0069006F00200069006F0021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come si chiamano le pietre che servono\nper far megaevolvere i Pokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Megaliti",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500670061006C0069007400690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Megapietre",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
